All the bugs reported to us (with the exception of one) have been
fixed.  The exception being a segmentation fault bug which we cannot
duplicate or trace.  While we are certain that there are additional
bugs to be found, for nearly two weeks we did not get a new bug
report, and it seems that (with the fixes) the Pl8 code has stabilized.

The bugfixes will be mailed tomorrow to comp.sources.games for posting.
We are adviced that posting them under any other name but "patchlevel" 
might cause book-keeping problems to archives.  So, the bugfixes will be
posted as Patchlevel 9.  Given our past practices, it feels funny to
call a 50K batch of diffs a "patchlevel"...

For the Development Team

